.book-extract/

# The reference books themselves — NEVER commit. Third-party copyrighted works
# (~354MB of PDF/EPUB), several of which exceed GitHub's per-file size limit
# anyway. Only the distilled, original notes derived from them belong in git:
# see supabase/seed/content/ and the reference_only corpus.
docs/momzo knowledge base - books/

# Loose credentials note (Sentry DSN + auth token) — never commit.
sentry deets.txt

